#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:5 43dc0e23b84941629fda2c54e327a4f2
msgid "Copter Release Procedures"
msgstr "Copter 发布流程"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:7 9d2e0a824f2441ee97e8740ed91873ff
msgid ""
"ArduPilot is very reliable because bug fixes are prioritised over new "
"features and releases are performed carefully and only after sufficient "
"testing has been completed."
msgstr "ArduPilot 非常可靠，因为缺陷修复优先于新功能开发，且发布经过充分测试后才会谨慎进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:9 8313a83a97d54c2cb465a2c38da79eb3
msgid ""
"This page outlines the steps that are normally followed for a Copter "
"release.  Listed mostly as a reference so that we don't forget the steps."
msgstr "本页概述了 Copter 版本发布通常遵循的步骤，主要作为参考，以防遗漏。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:12
#: 65fe45e82d1e45ecbe0c0c66e38cfe91
msgid "Alpha Testing"
msgstr "Alpha 测试"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:14
#: a6b68f885b40459b9119cd4c0bd5563a
msgid ""
"The `AutoTester <https://autotest.ardupilot.org/>`__ runs after each commit "
"and highlights issues that it has been setup to test."
msgstr ""
"`自动化测试器 <https://autotest.ardupilot.org/>`__ 在每次提交后运行，并突出显示其所设置测试中发现的问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:17
#: 47dbe5beea774d4ea2a43dcacd68a41d
msgid ""
"Developers and some Alpha testers perform intermittent tests of master "
"especially after new features have been added."
msgstr "开发者和部分 Alpha 测试人员会不定期对 master 分支进行测试，尤其是在新功能添加之后。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:21
#: d6ef82523ed040c3bc970fbf029a03e5
msgid "Releasing Beta Versions / Release Candidates"
msgstr "发布 Beta 版本/候选发布版"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:23
#: d20789abb3494972998ba494dc273c40
msgid ""
"Beta Testing / Release candidates are made available to beta testers through"
" the mission planner's \"Beta firmwares\" link.  The Mission Planner \"Beta "
"firmware\" link pulls the firmware from the `Copter/beta directory of "
"firmware.ardupilot.org. <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/beta/>`__"
msgstr ""
"Beta 测试/候选发布版通过 Mission Planner 的「Beta 固件」链接向 Beta 测试人员提供。Mission "
"Planner「Beta 固件」链接从 `firmware.ardupilot.org 的 Copter/beta 目录 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/beta/>`__ 拉取固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:30
#: 73a3320b52b940b9a8d804fe35d2ec95
msgid ""
"Someone with ardupilot GitHub commit access (normally Randy) makes the new "
"firmware available through the following steps:"
msgstr "拥有 ardupilot GitHub 提交权限的人员（通常是 Randy）按以下步骤发布新固件："

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:33
#: 762d1a7e6f744d11b53b00e07a2108cc
msgid "Create a new release branch or switch to an existing release branch"
msgstr "创建新的发布分支或切换到现有的发布分支"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:35
#: 8fe11beab12f4f79b544addf2aaf2eef
msgid "Open a Git Bash terminal in the ardupilot repository."
msgstr "在 ardupilot 仓库中打开 Git Bash 终端。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:37
#: 467e404741c64d36ade99dcaf721dbb1
msgid ""
"If this release involves a major or minor version increase (i.e. 4.3 to 4.4)"
" create a new branch in your local ardupilot repository:"
msgstr "如果此次发布涉及主版本或次版本升级（如从 4.3 升至 4.4），请在本地 ardupilot 仓库中创建新分支："

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:39
#: 7279e70b230a49d99ce45d71782f8d86
msgid ""
"``git checkout -b Copter-4.4`` (\"Copter-4.4\" should be replaced with the "
"correct major and minor version numbers)"
msgstr "``git checkout -b Copter-4.4``（「Copter-4.4」应替换为正确的主版本和次版本号）"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:40
#: 11685b3ad59446a3ad6373a7b1d7369c
msgid "``git push`` to create the new directory in the shared repo"
msgstr "``git push`` 以在共享仓库中创建新目录"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:41
#: 6c30629f5abe404f8a9db3e1b1d7b698
msgid ""
"click the `\"New Project\" button "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/projects?type=classic>`__ on the "
"GitHub projects page to create the corresponding \"Copter 4.x\" project.  "
"This is used to track features to be included in future releases"
msgstr ""
"在 GitHub 项目页面点击 `「New Project」按钮 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/projects?type=classic>`__ "
"创建对应的「Copter 4.x」项目，用于跟踪未来版本中要包含的功能"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:43
#: 2a9d86aa08224785acd8cf99e0292431
msgid ""
"Alternatively if this release is built on an earlier release branch checkout"
" the branch:"
msgstr "或者，如果此次发布基于早期发布分支，则切换到该分支："

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:45
#: 7d0b8d310b7940418a9acc7051997eaf
msgid ""
"``git checkout Copter-4.3`` to switch to the existing release branch "
"(\"Copter-4.3\" should be replaced with the correct major and minor version "
"numbers)"
msgstr "``git checkout Copter-4.3`` 以切换到现有发布分支（「Copter-4.3」应替换为正确的主版本和次版本号）"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:48
#: 3a2188da4ffa4b5fb1fb3e1bb5353ee8
msgid "Pull in changes from master"
msgstr "从 master 合入更改"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:50
#: c8fcbd1ea57e4f61890ae51be3591dbf
msgid ""
"Check the `ArduPilot Github Projects "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/projects?type=classic>`__ to "
"determine which PRs and commits should be included in this release. For "
"example the `Copter 4.3 project "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/projects/25>`__ holds the list of "
"PRs and commits that should be included in the next Copter-4.3 release."
msgstr ""
"查看 `ArduPilot Github 项目 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/projects?type=classic>`__ 确定哪些 PR "
"和提交应包含在此次发布中。例如，`Copter 4.3 项目 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/projects/25>`__ 包含下一个 Copter-4.3 "
"版本应包含的 PR 和提交列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:53
#: e4cf6261160b4bfc8da9472afe839108
msgid ""
"``git reset --hard origin/master``, ``git submodule update --recursive`` can"
" be used to reset the release branch to master if all of master should be "
"included (this is normal for at least the first few beta releases)"
msgstr ""
"如果应包含 master 的全部内容，可使用 ``git reset --hard origin/master``、``git submodule "
"update --recursive`` 将发布分支重置到 master（这在至少前几个 beta 版本发布时是正常操作）"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:55
#: da6be47489c04aafac4ff2d43521c4be
msgid "OR"
msgstr "或者"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:57
#: a2aab3f7f3c54000b26b5a20cf54e9b6
msgid "use ``gitk master`` to cherry-pick in just some changes from master"
msgstr "使用 ``gitk master`` 从 master 中择优挑选部分更改"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:60
#: 2dec674f1bed4a66be605283a2b85bce
msgid "Update version, release notes and tags"
msgstr "更新版本号、发布说明和标签"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:62
#: cf320907a05c48bb95bbab1dd2b1b6e2
msgid ""
"update the THISFIRMWARE and FIRMWARE_VERSION definitions in `version.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/version.h>`__"
msgstr ""
"更新 `version.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/version.h>`__"
" 中的 THISFIRMWARE 和 FIRMWARE_VERSION 定义"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:63
#: d389005b2f3842b19b2fde7141d63dcd
msgid ""
"update `ReleaseNotes.txt "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/ReleaseNotes.txt>`__"
msgstr ""
"更新 `ReleaseNotes.txt "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/ReleaseNotes.txt>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:64
#: c2bf2b37ea3a4a898fe67f260703ff8b
msgid ""
"``git show ArduCopter-beta`` and record the old git tag in case a backout is"
" required"
msgstr "``git show ArduCopter-beta`` 并记录旧的 git 标签，以备回退时使用"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:65
#: 50182adbad454a75aa223e1fa66cae1a
msgid ""
"``git tag -d ArduCopter-beta`` to delete the beta tag from the local repo"
msgstr "``git tag -d ArduCopter-beta`` 从本地仓库删除 beta 标签"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:66
#: d4c087327bce4809838e3bb58da70f63
msgid ""
"``git push origin :refs/tags/ArduCopter-beta`` to delete the beta tag from "
"the shared repo"
msgstr "``git push origin :refs/tags/ArduCopter-beta`` 从共享仓库删除 beta 标签"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:67
#: f40f2a5c2ac549dd9562d218af32d0fa
msgid ""
"``git tag ArduCopter-beta HEAD`` to create a new beta tag in the local repo"
msgstr "``git tag ArduCopter-beta HEAD`` 在本地仓库创建新的 beta 标签"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:68
#: 567ba38119274cd2a6ba5e3e337690ba
msgid ""
"``git push origin ArduCopter-beta`` to push the new beta tag to the shared "
"repo"
msgstr "``git push origin ArduCopter-beta`` 将新 beta 标签推送到共享仓库"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:69
#: ae2e31a3e418497799f23f01c7ec9b19
msgid ""
"check the `ArduPilot GitHub release list "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/releases>`__ to ensure all tags have"
" been updated in the shared repo"
msgstr ""
"查看 `ArduPilot GitHub 发布列表 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/releases>`__，确认共享仓库中所有标签已更新"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:71
#: 391792761b464faf93f6c7f33aa7c6f5
msgid ""
"Steps 4 to 8 above should be repeated for the ``ArduCopter-beta-heli`` tag "
"to release for Traditional Helicopters."
msgstr "以上第 4 至第 8 步应针对 ``ArduCopter-beta-heli`` 标签重复执行，以发布传统直升机版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:74
#: 74e0e86a090c4cb7b12e10379a636d27
msgid "Check the versions are available in Mission Planner"
msgstr "检查 Mission Planner 中的版本是否可用"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:76
#: 04aff6dfd57643cb82606dc027c3db64
msgid ""
"Wait 4hrs to 11hrs for the binaries to be built (check the `Build list "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/BuildSizes/builds.html>`__, `autotest-"
"output.txt <https://autotest.ardupilot.org/autotest-output.txt>`__  and/or "
"`manifest.json <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/manifest.json>`__ for status)"
" and then open the Mission Planner's Initial Setup > Install Firmware page "
"and click the \"Beta firmwares\" link and ensure that the version displayed "
"below each multicopter icon has updated."
msgstr ""
"等待 4 到 11 小时以完成固件构建（可查看 `构建列表 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/BuildSizes/builds.html>`__、`autotest-"
"output.txt <https://autotest.ardupilot.org/autotest-output.txt>`__ 和/或 "
"`manifest.json <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/manifest.json>`__ 了解状态），然后打开 "
"Mission Planner 的「初始设置 > 安装固件」页面，点击「Beta 固件」链接，确认每个多旋翼图标下方显示的版本已更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:82
#: 6132e5af64b94712b97d03edbe767d8e
msgid "Announce the release to the beta testers"
msgstr "向 Beta 测试人员公告发布信息"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:84
#: 7012717d2ed44404bee5ed9a937b2b10
msgid ""
"Let Beta testers know the new version is available by posting on these "
"sites:"
msgstr "在以下平台发布帖子，通知 Beta 测试人员新版本已可用："

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:86
#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:112
#: 07b2fd9253f6444283af1f2c1cfd0d00 6ac420afa20c464291f1a24668416867
msgid ""
"`Discuss's Copter category <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arducopter>`__ "
"(create a new category if required)"
msgstr ""
"`Discuss 的 Copter 分类 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arducopter>`__（如需要可创建新分类）"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:87
#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:113
#: 6eb2951967504cf7a86a3ea703e4752c 834a7605f5d2486ba9bc4039849829d3
msgid ""
"`ArduPilot facebook group "
"<https://www.facebook.com/groups/ArduPilot.org>`__.  Include the contents of"
" the ReleaseNotes.txt so people know what has changed and a video if "
"possible"
msgstr ""
"`ArduPilot Facebook 群组 <https://www.facebook.com/groups/ArduPilot.org>`__。附上"
" ReleaseNotes.txt 的内容，让大家了解更新内容，如有可能附上视频"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:90
#: 388c6750a22a4cedafe0dcca8a3833b5
msgid "Issue Tracking"
msgstr "问题跟踪"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:92
#: e6d6e76254ba4e22b094c6179d85a7f4
msgid ""
"beta testers should report issues in the appropriate `Discuss Copter forum "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arducopter>`__"
msgstr ""
"Beta 测试人员应在相应的 `Discuss Copter 论坛 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arducopter>`__ 上报告问题"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:93
#: 4dd1863a859843c0b7b500cf8254bff3
msgid ""
"the release manager (Randy) with help from other developers should "
"investigate issues and respond with the cause of the problem"
msgstr "发布经理（Randy）在其他开发者协助下应调查问题并反馈原因"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:94
#: 6ad4ee5141ff4f9fb55861dc9380dde5
msgid ""
"confirmed bugs should be added to the `ArduPilot Issues List "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__.  The issue's label "
"should be set to \"Copter\" and Projects and Milestone set to the upcoming "
"release if it should be addressed before release."
msgstr ""
"确认的缺陷应添加到 `ArduPilot 问题列表 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__。若该问题需在发布前解决，应将标签设置为「Copter」，并在"
" Projects 和 Milestone 中标注为即将发布的版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:97
#: 49759f66dc504fdc9c85908917c76598
msgid "Releasing Stable Versions"
msgstr "发布稳定版本"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:99
#: e471b38f0bcb40f188e0093e000916e7
msgid ""
"Stable releases are done after weeks or months of beta testing and normally "
"only after two weeks have passed with no unexplained crashes."
msgstr "稳定版本在经过数周或数月的 Beta 测试后发布，通常要求在连续两周内没有无法解释的崩溃。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:101
#: a3d6ffe6629c408985f22208dbdb4b36
msgid ""
"The go-no-go decision on a stable release is discussed on the preceding "
":ref:`weekly development call <ardupilot-discord-server>`.  This discussion "
"normally includes a review of the outstanding issues."
msgstr ""
"稳定版发布的「发/不发」决定在前一次 :ref:`每周开发例会 <ardupilot-discord-server>` "
"上讨论，通常包括对未解决问题的审查。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:103
#: fe15cec2839c4332ac087b0eda2e205b
msgid ""
"Releasing a stable version is the same as a beta version except the "
"``ArduCopter-stable`` and ``ArduCopter-stable-heli`` tags are used."
msgstr ""
"发布稳定版与 Beta 版流程相同，区别在于使用 ``ArduCopter-stable`` 和 ``ArduCopter-stable-heli`` "
"标签。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:105
#: e807549ec9fd4cb5aee159a6d11bcbe3
msgid "An additional tag is created including the patch release number:"
msgstr "还需创建包含补丁版本号的附加标签："

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:107
#: 427ae0ac53724d63af997f580b396406
msgid "``git tag Copter-4.3.0``"
msgstr "``git tag Copter-4.3.0``"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:108
#: a8053877f416466f9c2f6f13a12f902a
msgid "``git push origin Copter-4.3.0``"
msgstr "``git push origin Copter-4.3.0``"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:110
#: 9e66baa6ccfa439e958fba8b65b2ac00
msgid ""
"Announcements are done in much the same way as beta releases by posting on "
"these sites:"
msgstr "公告方式与 Beta 版本基本相同，在以下平台发布："

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:114
#: 4c875e43384b4374af7e45b4dc70077e
msgid "`LinkedIn <https://www.linkedin.com>`__"
msgstr "`LinkedIn <https://www.linkedin.com>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:115
#: 97624c62c5cf4bb1a0ab685d3b82958e
msgid ""
"Back on Github, `Draft a new release "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/releases>`__ and add the Discuss "
"link from above"
msgstr ""
"回到 Github，`起草新发布 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/releases>`__ 并添加上述 "
"Discuss 链接"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:117
#: 0d264665049a4f0d926eadc758f39d5d
msgid ""
"Mission Planner will also show a pop-up informing users that a new version "
"is available."
msgstr "Mission Planner 还会弹出提示，通知用户新版本已可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:120
#: 16b33b9dc8c64cdbb6025212680e154d
msgid "Didn't find what you are looking for?"
msgstr "没有找到您需要的内容？"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:122
#: e355b9d11d8d4f4b8e010c19696658f0
msgid ""
"If you think of something that should be added to this site, please `open an"
" issue <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ or post a comment "
"on the `ArduPilot Discord Chat <https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__."
msgstr ""
"如果您认为本站有需要补充的内容，请 `提交 issue "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ 或在 `ArduPilot Discord 聊天室"
" <https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ 发表评论。"
